# Base (the Beacon): exists from game start (never placeable). Respawn anchor + passive mineral income;
# conducts grid links like any structure. Its shield runs on EMITTER RULES (tickPower's hasShieldEmitter
# path): it drains the Base's own energy store (feed it power cables) and goes dark when starved;
# output/reach come from the "Base shield" tweaks, not this file. DAMAGEABLE - health drops to
# enemy territory/melee/projectiles - but the death sweep never destroys it (no lose condition yet).
# SHAPE (a placeholder on the 6x6x6 m box; uniform scales of the baseshapes variants): a stone dais (the
# root), a tower, a bronze crown, the large beacon DIAMOND that floats over it INSIDE the beam (gems.obj;
# out of the box; the beam starts at the crown, under the diamond) and four standing stones on the dais corners. The child pieces are render-only.
